{
	title: "Electricity Pylon",
	x: 7.0d,
	y: 14.0d,
	text: [
		"Electricity Pylon are a handy electric carrying machine that can cover wide areas.",
		"They come in wood and steel, steel is drastically better looking.",
		"",
		"To construct this type of pylon you need three components",
		"- Electricity Pylon",
		"- Capacitor (block)",
		"- Capacitor Bus.",
		"",
		"Place all on top of each other in that order starting with the Pylon at the top, with the Capacitor Bus having its red copper port exposed at the bottom.",
		"",
		"The transformer pylon will make its connected pylons and capacitor bus separate from the power grid, cycling power in but not out of it.",
		"",
		"To get power out, you may connect single pylons to the transformer or use the Capacitor bus.",
		"",
		"You may change the color of the cable connecting the pylons with dye."
	],
